Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:15:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] Add easy pin code management to the user password form

New section on the password page (dashboard and user profile) to set or
remove a 4-8 digit pin for in-network sign-in; saving a pin enables
EnableLocalPassword, removing it disables it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
